{"script":"s_4_8_1","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"梅尔科卡","text":"[show]嗯？两位有什么事情吗？[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"（告知阿纳伊尔的请求。）","tag":"tag_3"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"梅尔科卡","text":"[show][cm]原来如此，那老头子要给赫里奥夫办一场宴会啊。也算是不错的决定，是时候洗刷一下赫里奥夫过去的伤痛了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0.4,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara2","x":340,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]过去的伤痛？什么意思？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":0.6,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"梅尔科卡","text":"[show]有些事情还是让他自己告诉你们比较合适，不过我可以透露一些给你们。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"梅尔科卡","text":"[show]赫里奥夫和阿纳伊尔最初是没有任何交集的。但灾变之宴改变了一切……那场悲剧给森林的很多人都带来了不可磨灭的伤害。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2k","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2k","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]所以……到底发生什么事了？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2k","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":0.6,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"梅尔科卡","text":"[show]痛苦的回忆并非不能诉说，不过有些事情还是让当事人亲口说出来比较好。如果那个老头子愿意告诉你的话，那就由他来说比较好。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"梅尔科卡","text":"[show]好了回到正事吧，举办宴会除了美食，还得准备好一些装饰品。不过我手头上没有什么材料了，你们能把缺少的材料补齐吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"梅尔科卡","text":"[show]大概需要 1 个魔花花瓣和 1 团蕈人孢子簇。辛苦两位了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]好的，请交给我们吧。[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":